    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional Elevated Location .... Situated in the heart of Ballisodare Town, within walking distance of schools, shops, cafés, and local amenities, while enjoying the stunning backdrop of the Ox Mountains and the picturesque Ballisodare Falls.\nA Rated Energy Efficiency .... Built to the highest modern standards, delivering outstanding energy performance, reduced utility costs, and year round comfort.\nAir-to-Water Heat Pump System.... An energy-efficient and environmentally friendly heating solution providing reliable warmth and hot water throughout the home.\nUnderfloor Heating on Ground Floor.... Enjoy consistent, comfortable heat distribution while benefiting from a clean, uncluttered interior free from radiators.\nContemporary Fitted Kitchen and Stylish Sanitary Ware ..... Each home comes complete with a modern fitted kitchen and high-quality sanitary ware, carefully selected to complement contemporary family living.\nQuality by Teeling Street Developments... Developed by a trusted builder renowned for delivering stylish, energy efficient homes that combine modern design, comfort, and lasting value.\nLocation, Location, Location.... These impressive 166 sq.m. split level family homes are ideally positioned just five minutes from Sligo Town Centre and are well served by the 977 Local Link bus route, offering excellent connectivity and convenience for everyday living.\n\n"
      },
